# Used by BuildKit for frontend/Dockerfile only (context = repo root). Keeps host build output and
# the host's node_modules (with Windows/macOS native binaries) out of the Linux image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
# The web image is built from frontend/, docs/ and README.md only; the API has its own image.
backend
